:false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":14,"created_at":"2025-06-13T11:39:00Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T23:39:51Z","closed_at":"2025-06-18T23:29:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107486","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107486","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107486.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107486.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-18T23:29:52Z"},"body":"This change should slightly speed up render allocation calls. I haven't tested practical speed up, and there's some risk of regressions (if I made any mistakes). Editor seems to boot up fine though.\r\n\r\n### Background\r\nI was looking at `to_byte_array`, because the function seemed fishy to me. If raw data is needed, it's usually to be copied around, and in that case we shouldn't need to make copies.\r\n\r\nIndeed, I found that _all_ callers of the function were in rendering, used to copy around raw data. I adjusted APIs to use raw pointers instead, which is more idiomatic for this use case.\r\n\r\nThe one possible downside to this change is that internal calls aren't safety checked for validity (w.r.t. size), because there's no additional `size` being passed on. Personally, this is what I'd expect from such API. Still, it would be possible to change it to a `Span` based API, using something like `array.byte_span()`, passing down an additional size information. I'm open to making this change based on feedback.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107486/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107486/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}